What:           /sys/bus/platform/devices/*hdmi*/link_state
Date:           October 2026
Contact:        localhost-copilot <318096335+localhost-copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
Description:
                Read-only diagnostic snapshot for the T7 ENC2 HDMI transmitter.
                Reports TOP active size, PHY controls, transport controls and
                the AVI, audio and DRM InfoFrame banks as hexadecimal bytes.
                SCDC TMDS configuration and status flags are read from the
                connected sink; each read includes its Linux error result.
                An unsupported or disconnected sink may return a negative
                result. Reading never writes sink SCDC configuration.

                Packet reads serialize against packet updates and restore the
                previous bank selector. The complete snapshot is not atomic
                with respect to a modeset; read it while the mode is stable.
                This interface is available only for the ENC2 modeset profile.
